        {
            "+content": "\"Mooo.\" Lord Momon cries out, ready for her meal. \"Mooo.\" Baby sister cries out, miserable and cold. As a young teen, sweet Miki learns the bizarre truth about her family: for centuries, they have harnessed half-cow, half-human beasts known as \"kudan\" for their wealth and power. And soon, another shall be born. The hour approaches. Her mother moans in pain as the contractions begin. But all poor Miki can plead is \"Mother, Mother, Please Don't Give Birth to a Monster.\"",
